; T-0015D golden: Tatar.ru.zmp - 'case' with 12 range labels, div/mod, no-match fall-through,
; zoom guard 3<=Z<=18 (Z := GetZ-1). Outside the guard, ResultURL is never assigned -> ''
; (tile does not exist), same rule as map10.
; Z:=GetZ-1; Y:=Round(IntPower(2,Z))-1-GetY; X:=GetX; each split div/mod 1000, zero-padded
; via the case statement (0..9 -> '00'+n, 10..99 -> '0'+n, 100..999 -> n); SZ similarly (0..9
; -> '0'+n, 10..99 -> n).
; P1 (Z=0), P2 (Z=1): guard fails (Z<3) -> tile does not exist.
; P3 (Z=13): Y=8192-1-5678=2513 -> Y1=2,Y2=513; X1=1,X2=234.
; P4 (Z=17): Y=131072-1-87654=43417 -> Y1=43,Y2=417; X1=131,X2=71.

